- Optional: \`description\` on an option; \`recommended\` on a question, a list of option letters (at most one for \`single\`).
- Free-text answers are always allowed.
- Several questions per file are allowed; all must be answered before the stage continues.
- Present choices neutrally. Never decide on the human's behalf.

